osatool
https://melomac.com/osatool

The source code is available at: https://codeberg.org/melomac/osatool
A mirror is available at: https://github.com/melomac/osatool
The osatool binary is built from the tag matching its version (osatool --version).

osatool is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3, see LICENSE.

osatool is built on the work of the projects listed below. It started as a Swift port of the last of them, which is
itself based on the first two. The osatool binary also includes swift-argument-parser, in the version Package.resolved
pins.


